    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2026-06-10 23:33:00 CDT Expires: 2026-06-11 00:15:00 CDT Urgency: Immediate Severity: Severe Certainty: Observed Instruction: For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a building. Target Area: Harvey, KS At 1133 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Newton, moving east at 25 mph.\nHAZARD...Golf ball size hail and 60 mph wind gusts.\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\nIMPACT...People and animals outdoors will be injured. Expect hail damage to roofs, siding, windows, and vehicles. Expect wind damage to roofs, siding, and trees.\nLocations impacted include... Newton, North Newton, Whitewater, and Newton Airport.\nThis includes Interstate 135 between Mile Markers 27 and 37.",
